              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E0D8C8;padding:19px 0;display:flex;gap:19px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#1A3D6B;color:#fff;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">1</div><div><h4 style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1C1A16;margin-bottom:5px;\">WhatsApp Us or Book a Free Call</h4><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6B6355;line-height:1.65;\">Send a message in Bengali or English. Or book a free 15-minute call. We respond in under 2 minutes, any time of day or night.</p><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:#25D366;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:100px;margin-top:6px;\">📲 wa.me/917288818181</span></div></div><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E0D8C8;padding:19px 0;display:flex;gap:19px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#1A3D6B;color:#fff;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">2</div><div><h4 style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1C1A16;margin-bottom:5px;\">We Visit Parents & Do a CMIG Safety Audit</h4><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6B6355;line-height:1.65;\">Our gerontologist visits your parents, assesses their health, home safety, medication, and social needs. All documented.</p></div></div><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E0D8C8;padding:19px 0;display:flex;gap:19px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#1A3D6B;color:#fff;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">3</div><div><h4 style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1C1A16;margin-bottom:5px;\">Weekly \"Ma Bhalo Ache\" WhatsApp Update</h4><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6B6355;line-height:1.65;\">Every week, you receive a short video on WhatsApp — your parent saying they're well, plus our written care update. Sleep peacefully.</p><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:#25D366;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:100px;margin-top:6px;\">📲 Video update to your number</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:19px 0;display:flex;gap:19px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:#1A3D6B;color:#fff;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">4</div><div><h4 style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1C1A16;margin-bottom:5px;\">Any Emergency — We're There in 1 Hour</h4><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6B6355;line-height:1.65;\">If anything happens, we're the first responders. We reach, call ambulance, coordinate hospital, and update you in real time on WhatsApp.</p></div></div>"
              }
